<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine April inflation 0.8 pct vs 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine April inflation 0.8 pct vs 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's monthly inflation accelerated to 0.8 percent in April from 0.1 percent in March, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE CONSUMER PRICES     APR 97    MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +0.8	+0.1	+2.4</p>
<p>Prices have risen 4.4 percent so far this year. The governmetn has forecast annual inflation at 25 percent in 1997 after 39.7 percent last year.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
